Test tests/drivers/uart/uart_async_api/  successfully tested with  the following platforms:

-  b_u585i_iot02a on  usart3   --> connect   D0 / D1 on CN14
-  nucleo_u575zi_q on usart2 --> connect D52 / D53 on CN9
-   _or_  nucleo_u575zi_q on usart 3  --> connect D45 / D46 on CN8 and overlay 
```
&usart3 {
	pinctrl-0 = <&usart3_tx_pc10 &usart3_rx_pc11>;
	pinctrl-names = "default";
	current-speed = <115200>;
	status = "okay";
	
	dmas = <&gpdma1 0 29 0x440
		&gpdma1 1 28 0x480>;
	dma-names = "tx", "rx";
};

```

